CONTENTS:
The knee MR volumes are saved as Python pickle objects. See example.py for details regarding accessing individual volumes.
File contents of this archive (approx. 3.45 GB of data):
|- READ.ME - file contains some basic information regarding this archive
|- example.py - Python script used to demonstrate how to access the files
|- metadata.csv - comma-delimited (csv) data containing descriptions of distinct volume (header attribute information included)
|- example.pck - an example Python .pck file (just to inspect whether one wants to be bothered downloading the rest of the archive)
|- volumetric_data.7z - directory containing all knee MR volumes, archived using 7-zip losless file compression


HISTORY:
This dataset was originally published on the URL http://www.riteh.uniri.hr/~istajduh/projects/kneeMRI/ in 2017, but was recently moved to Zenodo because ... reasons. The publication date stated is tied to the old repository.


